 "statement": "Let $\\mathcal A$ be as in [def-sfb-finite-shriek-adjunction] and let $f$ admit a\ncompactification. The derived lower shriek\n$Rf_!\\colon D(X_{\\mathrm{proét}},\\mathcal A)\\to D(Y_{\\mathrm{proét}},\\mathcal A)$ of\n[def-sfb-finite-derived-lower-shriek] is a left adjoint.",
