   "text": "Its right adjoint is $Rf^!$, by [def-sfb-finite-shriek-adjunction]. Besides the exact\nadjunction $D(i_!)\\dashv D(i^*)$, the argument uses only that $Rg_*$ is a left adjoint for\nthe proper part $g$ of the compactification.",
